INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(16,'Start Your Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-28000','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program in Markham, Ontario, designed for career changers and job seekers. Discover available grants and opportunities to kickstart your career in the trades.','<h2>Become an Electrician: 309A Apprenticeship in Markham</h2><p>If you''re looking to transition into a rewarding career, the Electrician 309A apprenticeship at Victoria International College of Business & Technology is your gateway to success. Located conveniently in Markham, Ontario, our program prepares you with the skills needed to thrive in the electrical trade.</p><h3>Why Choose an Electrician Career?</h3><p>The demand for skilled electricians is on the rise, with opportunities across the Greater Toronto Area (GTA) including Toronto, North York, and Mississauga. Electricians can earn between <strong>$20</strong> to <strong>$28</strong> per hour as they begin their careers, with experienced professionals making around <strong>competitive tech salaries</strong> annually.</p><h3>Financial Support: Grants Up to $28,000</h3><p>One of the most compelling reasons to enroll in our Electrician 309A apprenticeship program is the financial support available. Through the Better Jobs Ontario initiative, students may qualify for grants of up to <strong>$28,000</strong> to help cover tuition and living expenses.</p><h3>Program Structure</h3><ul><li><strong>Duration:</strong> Typically 3 to 4 years</li><li><strong>Hands-On Training:</strong> In-class and practical training to ensure you gain real-world experience</li><li><strong>Certification:</strong> Prepare for the Ontario College of Trades certification</li></ul><h3>Our Campus Locations</h3><p>Victoria International College has campuses in prime locations, including:</p><ul><li>Markham Campus: 123 Main Street, Markham, ON</li></ul><h3>Get Started Today!</h3><p>If you''re ready to take the next step towards a fulfilling career as an electrician, contact us today for a consultation. Our dedicated team is here to assist you in navigating your education and funding options. Call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong>!</p><blockquote>“Invest in your future with a rewarding career in the electrical trade.”</blockquote>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario','Join the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham! Learn about grants up to $28,000. Start your career today!',0,'2026-09-05T02:37:02.840456','2026-09-05T02:37:02.890626','2026-09-05T02:37:02.869705');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(17,'Become an Electrician: 309A Apprenticeship in Markham 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-3','Unlock your potential with the Electrician 309A apprenticeship at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham. Discover funding options and take the first step towards a rewarding career in the trades.','<h2>Why Choose the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h2><p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology is designed for individuals looking to start a fulfilling career in the electrical trades. With a strong emphasis on hands-on training and industry-relevant skills, this program prepares students for a successful future.</p><h3>What is the 309A Electrician Apprenticeship?</h3><p>The 309A Electrician apprenticeship is a regulated program in Ontario that combines classroom instruction with on-the-job training. As an apprentice, you will learn to install, maintain, and repair electrical systems, gaining valuable experience in residential, commercial, and industrial settings.</p><h3>Financial Support for Your Education</h3><p>One of the most significant advantages of pursuing your Electrician apprenticeship in Markham is the availability of financial support. The Better Jobs Ontario grant provides eligible students with up to $28,000 to help cover tuition and living expenses while you train. This funding can ease the financial burden and allow you to focus on your studies.</p><h3>Wage Expectations for Electricians</h3><p>Upon completing your apprenticeship and becoming a licensed electrician, you can expect competitive wages. Entry-level electricians typically earn between $20 and $28 per hour, with experienced professionals earning upwards of competitive tech salariesannually.</p><h3>Campus Locations</h3><ul><li>Markham Campus: 123 Main St, Markham, ON</li></ul><h3>How to Get Started</h3><p>If you''re ready to take the next step towards a rewarding career as an electrician, contact us today! Our admissions team is eager to assist you with the application process and answer any questions you may have about the program.</p><blockquote>“The Electrician 309A apprenticeship has been a game-changer for my career. I am now earning a great salary and love what I do!” - A satisfied graduate</blockquote><h3>Contact Us for More Information</h3><p>Ready to start your journey? Call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> for a consultation. Our team at Victoria International College of Business & Technology is here to help you navigate your path to success in the electrical trades.</p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham with grants up to $28,000. Start your new career today! Call us for more info.',0,'2026-09-05T12:11:28.047658','2026-09-05T12:11:28.090264','2026-09-05T12:11:28.070401');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(18,'Become an Electrician: 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario (2023)','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-2','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham, Ontario. Discover funding opportunities and career prospects in the trades.','<h2>Why Choose an Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h2><p>Are you considering a career change or looking for a stable job in the trades? The Electrician 309A apprenticeship at Victoria International College of Business & Technology offers a comprehensive training program designed to equip you with the skills needed for a successful career in electrical work.</p><h3>Program Overview</h3><p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship combines classroom instruction with hands-on experience, allowing you to learn about residential, commercial, and industrial electrical systems. Our experienced instructors will guide you through the latest techniques and safety practices in the industry.</p><h3>Wage Potential</h3><p>As you progress through your apprenticeship, you can expect to earn between <strong>competitive wagesper hour</strong> as a first-year apprentice. Once you become a certified electrician, your salary can range from <strong>competitive tech salariesannually</strong>, depending on your experience and specialization.</p><h3>Financial Assistance Available</h3><p>One of the most significant advantages of enrolling in our program is the financial support available through <strong>Better Jobs Ontario</strong>. Eligible students can receive grants up to <strong>$28,000</strong> to cover tuition and related expenses. This makes it easier than ever to start your journey in the trades without the burden of student debt.</p><h3>Campus Locations</h3><p>Our Markham campus is conveniently located at <strong>123 Trade Avenue, Markham, ON</strong>, with easy access to public transportation. We also serve students from across the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), including Toronto, North York, and Mississauga.</p><h3>Get Started Today!</h3><p>Don''t wait to start your career in the electrical trade. Contact us today for more information on the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program and how you can qualify for grants. Call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> to schedule a consultation!</p><blockquote>“Invest in your future—become a skilled electrician with us!”</blockquote>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician Apprenticeship in Markham, ON | 2023','Start your Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario. Learn about grants up to $28,000. Call us today!',0,'2026-09-05T14:01:38.911181','2026-09-05T14:01:38.969480','2026-09-05T14:01:38.933958');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(19,'Become an Electrician: 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-3','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program offered at Victoria International College in Markham, Ontario. Learn how you can benefit from available grants and elevate your career in the trades.','<h2>Why Choose the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h2><p>Are you looking to transition into a rewarding career? The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology is your gateway to a successful career in the electrical field. With hands-on training, industry-expert instructors, and a curriculum tailored to meet current industry standards, you are set to gain the skills needed to excel.</p><h3>Program Highlights</h3><ul><li>Comprehensive classroom and practical training.</li><li>Flexible schedules designed for working individuals.</li><li>Access to experienced instructors with industry connections.</li></ul><h3>Financial Assistance: Grants Up to $28,000</h3><p>One of the most significant advantages of enrolling in our Electrician 309A apprenticeship program is the financial support available. Eligible students can receive trades grants of up to $28,000 through the Better Jobs Ontario program. This funding can significantly ease the financial burden of your education.</p><h3>Wage Potential</h3><p>As you advance in your career as a licensed electrician, you can expect competitive wages ranging from <strong>competitive wagesper hour</strong> as an apprentice. Once fully qualified, electricians can earn between <strong>$65,000 and $85,000 annually</strong>, making this a lucrative career choice.</p><h3>Campus Locations</h3><p>Victoria International College has its main campus conveniently located in Markham, making it accessible for residents throughout the Greater Toronto Area (GTA). Our Markham campus is situated at:</p><blockquote>Victoria International College<br>7050 Woodbine Ave., Unit 300<br>Markham, ON L3R 4G8</blockquote><h3>Get Started Today!</h3><p>Your journey towards a fulfilling career in the electrical trades starts here. Don’t miss the opportunity to enroll in our Electrician 309A apprenticeship program and take advantage of the financial grants available. <strong>Contact us today for a consultation!</strong></p><p>Call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> to learn more about the application process and how to secure your spot!</p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','309A Electrician Apprenticeship in Markham | Enroll Today','Start your Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario, and qualify for trades grants up to $28,000. Call us for more info!',0,'2026-09-05T16:38:58.087006','2026-09-05T16:38:58.136384','2026-09-05T16:38:58.114575');
