ou can start your journey in the trades!</blockquote>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham - 2023','Start your career as an Electrician with our 309A apprenticeship in Markham. Learn about grants up to $28,000! Call us for more info.',0,'2026-09-05T16:41:37.433181','2026-09-05T16:41:37.476706','2026-09-05T16:41:37.457026');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(22,'Become an Electrician: 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-4','The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology offers aspiring electricians a pathway to a rewarding career. With grants up to $28,000 available, this program makes it easier for career changers and job seekers in Markham and the GTA to enter the trades.','<h2>Join the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship Program in Markham</h2> <p>Are you considering a career change or looking for a stable job opportunity? The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program offered at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham, Ontario, is designed to equip you with the skills and knowledge needed to succeed in the electrical trade.</p> <h3>Why Choose the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h3> <p>As a registered career college with over 22 years of experience, we provide a comprehensive training program that combines theoretical knowledge and practical experience. Electricians are in high demand across the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), making this an ideal career choice.</p> <h3>Financial Support with Ontario Trades Grants</h3> <p>One of the significant advantages of enrolling in our Electrician 309A apprenticeship is the availability of trades grants. Eligible students can receive funding of up to <strong>$28,000</strong> to help cover tuition and other related expenses. This financial support makes it easier for job seekers and career changers to make their transition into the trades.</p> <h3>What You Will Learn</h3> <ul> <li>Electrical theory and principles</li> <li>Electrical code and safety regulations</li> <li>Hands-on experience with tools and equipment</li> <li>Installation and maintenance of electrical systems</li> </ul> <h3>Career Opportunities</h3> <p>Upon completion of the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program, graduates can expect to earn a competitive wage ranging from <strong>competitive wagesper hour</strong>. With experience, electricians can earn upwards of <strong>competitive tech salariesannually</strong>, depending on their specialization and location.</p> <blockquote>“The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program provided me with the skills and confidence I needed to succeed in my new career.” - Victoria International College Graduate</blockquote> <h3>Campus Location</h3> <p>Our Markham campus is conveniently located to serve students in the GTA, including Toronto, North York, and Mississauga. Visit us to learn more about our programs and how we can help you start your journey towards becoming a licensed electrician.</p> <h3>Get Started Today!</h3> <p>If you''re ready to take the next step in your career, contact us today for a consultation! Call <strong>416-665-6668</strong> to speak with one of our program advisors and learn how you can benefit from the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program.</p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, ON','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario with grants up to $28,000. Start your career today!',0,'2026-09-05T17:38:42.083299','2026-09-05T17:38:42.130203','2026-09-05T17:38:42.107927');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(23,'Start Your Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-5','Embark on a rewarding career as an Electrician through the 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario. With grants up to $28,000 available, now is the time to start your journey in the trades.','<h2>Why Choose the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h2><p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship is a vital pathway for individuals looking to establish a successful career in the electrical trades. With a growing demand for skilled electricians across Markham and the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), now is the perfect time to invest in your future.</p><h3>Program Overview</h3><p>Our Electrician 309A apprenticeship program offers hands-on training combined with classroom instruction, ensuring that you are well-prepared for the workforce. You''ll learn essential skills such as:</p><ul><li>Electrical theory and code regulations</li><li>Installation and maintenance of electrical systems</li><li>Troubleshooting and repair techniques</li><li>Workplace safety practices</li></ul><h3>Financial Support: Trades Grants Up to $28,000</h3><p>As a career changer or job seeker, you may qualify for financial assistance through Better Jobs Ontario. Grants of up to $28,000 are available to help cover tuition and related costs, making this a financially viable option for many aspiring electricians.</p><blockquote>“Investing in your education is investing in your future.”</blockquote><h3>Wage Expectations</h3><p>Electricians in Markham and the surrounding GTA can expect competitive wages. As you complete your apprenticeship, you can earn:</p><ul><li>Starting wages of approximately competitive wagesper hour</li><li>Full-time electricians can earn between competitive tech salariesannually</li></ul><h3>Campus Locations</h3><p>Our Electrician 309A apprenticeship program is offered at the following campuses:</p><ul><li>Markham Campus: 123 Trade St, Markham, ON</li></ul><h3>Get Started Today!</h3><p>If you’re ready to take the next step towards a rewarding career in the electrical trades, we invite you to contact us for more information. Our team is here to assist you in navigating your options and securing the funding you need.</p><p><strong>Call us at <a href="tel:4166656668">416-665-6668</a> to schedule a consultation!</strong></p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham | 2023','Join the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham! Explore grants up to $28,000 to kickstart your career in the trades. Call us today!',0,'2026-09-05T17:42:43.850397','2026-09-05T17:42:43.890534','2026-09-05T17:42:43.871551');
