e electrical trade. Contact us for more information about the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program and how you can qualify for Ontario trades grants.</p><blockquote>Call us today at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> for a consultation and start your journey towards a brighter future!</blockquote>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician Apprenticeship & Grants in Markham','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham with grants up to $28,000. Start your career today!',0,'2026-09-05T21:20:58.613140','2026-09-05T21:20:58.657108','2026-09-05T21:20:58.637499');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(33,'Electrician 309A Apprenticeship Opportunities in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-28000-3','Discover the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham. Learn how you can benefit from up to $28,000 in grants to kickstart your career in the trades.','<h2>Why Choose an Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham?</h2><p>As a career changer or job seeker in the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), pursuing an Electrician 309A apprenticeship at Victoria International College of Business & Technology offers a pathway to a rewarding profession. With the demand for skilled electricians on the rise, this program equips you with the necessary skills and knowledge to thrive in the trades.</p><h3>Program Overview</h3><p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program is designed to provide hands-on training and theoretical knowledge in electrical systems, safety practices, and code regulations. As you progress, you’ll gain practical experience through on-the-job training.</p><h3>Financial Support: Better Jobs Ontario Grants</h3><p>One of the most significant advantages of enrolling in this program is the financial support available. The Better Jobs Ontario initiative provides grants of up to <strong>$28,000</strong> for eligible students pursuing training in high-demand sectors, including the trades.</p><h3>Wage Potential</h3><p>Electricians in Ontario enjoy competitive wages, typically ranging from <strong>competitive wagesper hour</strong> as apprentices. Once fully qualified, electricians can earn between <strong>$65,000 and $85,000 annually</strong>, making it a lucrative career choice.</p><h3>Campus Locations</h3><p>Victoria International College has campuses conveniently located in:</p><ul><li>Markham: 123 Main St, Markham, ON</li></ul><h3>Take the Next Step in Your Career</h3><p>If you’re ready to take the leap into a fulfilling career as an electrician, don’t hesitate to reach out. Our team at Victoria International College is here to assist you in navigating your educational journey.</p><blockquote>“Invest in your future today; the electrical trade is a promising and rewarding field!”</blockquote><h3>Contact Us for More Information</h3><p>For more details about the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program and to see if you qualify for the Better Jobs Ontario grants, call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> or fill out our consultation form.</p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician Apprenticeship in Markham - $28,000 Grants','Explore Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham. Get up to $28,000 in trades grants. Start your career today!',0,'2026-09-05T21:32:48.146061','2026-09-05T21:32:48.196240','2026-09-05T21:32:48.174107');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(34,'Transform Your Career with an Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario (2023)','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-12','Unlock a rewarding career as an Electrician with our 309A apprenticeship program in Markham, Ontario. Explore available trades grants and take the first step towards a brighter future.','<h2>Explore the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship Program</h2> <p>Are you looking to shift your career towards a rewarding trade? The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham is designed to equip you with the skills necessary to succeed in the electrical industry. With over 22 years of experience in training career-focused individuals, we are dedicated to helping you reach your full potential.</p> <h3>Program Highlights</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Hands-on Training:</strong> Gain practical experience through our comprehensive training modules.</li> <li><strong>Expert Instructors:</strong> Learn from industry professionals with years of experience.</li> <li><strong>Flexible Learning Options:</strong> Tailored schedules that fit your busy lifestyle.</li> </ul> <h3>Financial Assistance: Better Jobs Ontario Grants</h3> <p>One of the best parts of our program is the financial support available to you. With Better Jobs Ontario grants, you could receive funding up to <strong>$28,000+</strong> to help cover tuition and other educational expenses. This initiative is aimed at supporting individuals who are looking to retrain and enter the workforce in high-demand trades.</p> <h3>Career Opportunities and Wage Facts</h3> <p>As a graduate of the Electrician 309A apprenticeship, you can expect to earn between <strong>competitive wagesper hour</strong> starting out, with experienced electricians earning upwards of <strong>competitive tech salariesper year</strong>. The demand for skilled electricians continues to grow in the Markham and Greater Toronto Area, making this a stable and lucrative career choice.</p> <h3>Campus Location</h3> <p>Join us at our conveniently located campus in Markham: </p> <ul> <li><strong>Markham Campus:</strong> 123 Main St, Markham, ON</li>  </ul> <h3>Get Started Today!</h3> <blockquote>Don''t let the opportunity pass you by—take charge of your career with the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College!</blockquote> <p>For more information or to schedule a consultation, call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong>. Our team is here to help you navigate your career change and answer any questions you may have.</p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, ON','Start your Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario! Learn about grants up to $28,000 and kickstart your career today!',0,'2026-09-05T21:34:22.558633','2026-09-05T21:34:22.607854','2026-09-05T21:34:22.586164');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(35,'Become an Electrician: 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-6','Discover the opportunities available through the 309A Electrician apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario. With grants up to $28,000, it’s the perfect time to start your career in the trades.','<h2>Kickstart Your Career with the 309A Electrician Apprenticeship</h2>
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(36,'Electrician 309A Apprenticeship Opportunities in Markham, Ontario 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-13','Discover the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program offered at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham, Ontario. Learn about potential grants and career prospects in the trades sector.','<h2>Kickstart Your Career with an Electrician 309A Apprenticeship</h2><p>Are you looking to change careers or enhance your skills? The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham, Ontario, is your gateway to a rewarding career in the trades. With the growing demand for skilled electricians in the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), now is the perfect time to enroll.</p><h3>Why Choose the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h3><p>Electricians play a crucial role in our modern society, handling everything from residential wiring to complex commercial electrical systems. By completing the Electrician 309A apprenticeship, you will gain hands-on experience while working under the guidance of licensed professionals. This program not only prepares you for the Ontario College of Trades certification but also opens doors to various career opportunities.</p><h3>Financial Support: Ontario Trades Grants Worth Up to $28,000</h3><p>Taking the leap into a new career can be daunting, but financial support is available! Under the Better Jobs Ontario program, eligible students can receive grants of up to $28,000 to cover tuition and other related expenses. This initiative is designed to help you succeed in your apprenticeship and secure a stable future.</p><h3>Career Prospects and Earnings</h3><p>Upon completing your Electrician 309A apprenticeship, you can expect competitive wages. Electricians in Ontario earn between competitive wagesper hour during their apprenticeship and can make an impressive competitive tech salariesannually once fully qualified. This is a lucrative career path with numerous opportunities for growth.</p><h3>Our Campus Locations</h3><p>Victoria International College has campuses located conveniently in Markham and North York, making it accessible for students across the GTA. Visit us at:</p><ul><li>Markham Campus: 123 Main St, Markham, ON</li></ul><h3>Get Started Today!</h3><p>Don''t miss out on this opportunity to transform your career. For more information on the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program and available grants, contact us today!</p><blockquote>Call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> for a free consultation.</blockquote>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician Apprenticeship in Markham | Grants Available','Start your Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario. Access up to $28,000 in grants today! Call us for more info.',0,'2026-09-05T21:51:14.106350','2026-09-05T21:51:14.151035','2026-09-05T21:51:14.131844');
