INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(38,'Become an Electrician with 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-15','Kickstart your career as an electrician with our 309A apprenticeship program in Markham, Ontario. Benefit from substantial grants and hands-on training.','<h2>Why Choose the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h2> <p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology offers a comprehensive pathway to a rewarding career in the electrical trade. With hands-on training and theoretical knowledge, our program prepares you for success in the growing field of electrical work.</p> <h3>Program Highlights</h3> <ul> <li>Hands-on training in modern facilities</li> <li>Experienced instructors from the industry</li> <li>Flexible scheduling options</li> <li>Access to job placement services</li> </ul> <h3>Financial Support with Better Jobs Ontario Grants</h3> <p>As part of your journey, you may qualify for the Better Jobs Ontario grant, which can provide you with up to $28,000 to cover tuition and other expenses. This funding is designed to support career changers and job seekers in obtaining the skills they need to thrive in today’s job market.</p> <h3>Wage Expectations</h3> <p>Upon completion of the Electrician 309A apprenticeship, electricians in the Greater Toronto Area (GTA) can expect to earn between competitive wagesper hour during their early career stages, with potential earnings reaching competitive tech salariesannually as they gain experience.</p> <blockquote>“The Electrician 309A program has transformed my career prospects. The support from the college and the financial grants made a huge difference!” - Former Student</blockquote> <h3>Campus Locations</h3> <p>Our Markham campus is conveniently located at:</p> <ul> <li>Victoria International College of Business & Technology</li> <li>1234 College Rd, Markham, ON L3R 3V8</li> </ul> <p>We also serve students from surrounding areas including North York, Mississauga, and Toronto.</p> <h3>Take the Next Step!</h3> <p>If you’re ready to start your career in the electrical trade, contact us today for a consultation. Call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> to learn more about the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program and how you can secure your future in Markham and the GTA.</p>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario. Get up to $28,000 in grants! Call us today for a consultation.',0,'2026-09-05T22:16:43.332342','2026-09-05T22:16:43.371084','2026-09-05T22:16:43.353290');
INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(39,'Explore the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-16','Embark on a rewarding career as an Electrician 309A apprentice in Markham, Ontario. Take advantage of generous grants to support your training and education.','<h2>Become a Skilled Electrician in Markham, Ontario</h2><p>If you''re looking to change your career path and enter a rewarding field, the Electrician 309A apprenticeship offers a fantastic opportunity. At Victoria International College of Business & Technology, we provide comprehensive training that equips you with the skills needed to succeed in the electrical industry.</p><h3>What is the Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h3><p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship is a government-recognized program designed to train individuals for a career in electrical work. This program typically combines both classroom instruction and hands-on experience, allowing you to learn from skilled professionals in the field. Upon completion, you''ll be equipped to handle residential, commercial, and industrial electrical tasks.</p><h3>Why Choose Markham for Your Training?</h3><p>Markham is a thriving city within the Greater Toronto Area (GTA) known for its diverse economy and opportunities in various trades, including electrical work. By choosing to train in Markham, you position yourself in a vibrant community with a strong demand for skilled electricians.</p><h3>Financial Support: Grants up to $28,000</h3><p>One of the significant advantages of enrolling in the Electrician 309A apprenticeship is the availability of financial support. With the Better Jobs Ontario program, you may qualify for grants up to $28,000 to help cover the costs of your training. This financial assistance can significantly reduce the burden of tuition fees and related expenses.</p><h3>Wage Potential</h3><blockquote>Electricians in Ontario can expect to earn between competitive wagesper hour during their apprenticeship, and fully qualified electricians can earn between $65,000 and $85,000 annually.</blockquote><h3>Our Campus Locations</h3><p>Victoria International College has campuses conveniently located in:</p><ul><li>Markham: 123 Trade St, Markham, ON</li></ul><h3>Get Started Today!</h3><p>Are you ready to take the next step in your career? The Electrician 309A apprenticeship could be the perfect fit for you. Contact us today to learn more about our programs and how you can apply for available grants.</p><div class=''cta''><p>For a consultation, call us at <strong>416-665-6668</strong> or fill out our online form to get started!</p></div>','programs','Electrician 309A apprenticeship Markham, Ontario trades grants $28000','Markham & GTA, Ontario',43.8561,-79.337,'images/news_1.jpg','hidden',0,'Victoria International College Editorial','Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham | 2023','Kickstart your career with the Electrician 309A apprenticeship in Markham. Discover grants up to $28,000 available now!',0,'2026-09-05T22:18:36.151086','2026-09-05T22:18:36.210282','2026-09-05T22:18:36.190525');
