INSERT INTO "articles" VALUES(48,'Start Your Electrician 309A Apprenticeship in Markham, Ontario - 2023','electrician-309a-apprenticeship-markham-ontario-trades-grants-23','Explore the Electrician 309A apprenticeship program at Victoria International College of Business & Technology in Markham, Ontario. Learn about grants and career opportunities in the trades sector.','<h2>Why Choose an Electrician 309A Apprenticeship?</h2><p>The Electrician 309A apprenticeship program is a fantastic pathway for career changers and job seekers interested in the trades. With a growing demand for skilled tradespeople in Markham and the Greater Toronto Area (GTA), this program offers not only hands-on training but also the potential for lucrative job opportunities.</p><h3>Program Overview</h3><p>Our Electrician 309A apprenticeship program is designed to provide you with the essential skills needed to excel in the electrical field. Participants will gain valuable experience through a combination of classroom instruction and on-the-job training.</p><ul><li><strong>Duration:</strong> Typically 4-5 years</li><li><strong>Format:</strong> In-class and field training</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> Markham and North York campuses</li></ul><h3>Wage Potential</h3><p>Upon completion of the Electrician 309A apprenticeship, graduates can expect to earn competitive wages ranging from <strong>competitive wagesper hour</strong>. With experience, electricians in the GTA can earn upwards of <strong>competitive tech salariesannually</strong>.</p><h3>Financial Support: Better Jobs Ontario Grants</h3><p>To help ease the financial burden of training, Ontario offers trades grants up to <strong>$28,000</strong> for eligible individuals. This funding can significantly offset the costs associated with your apprenticeship, making it more accessible for all job seekers.</p><h3>Campus Locations</h3><p>Victoria International College of Business & Technology has multiple campuses in the GTA, including:</p><ul><